      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I&#39;m having a little trouble understanding how Unity&#39;s Cryo Bot card works given some of the rules clarifications that have been collected in Spiff&#39;s PDF.</p><p>Cryo Bot says: &quot;Whenever this card is dealt damage, it deals each none-hero target 1 cold damage.&quot; Cryo Bot has 1 HP.</p><p>Given the clarification that damage dealt = HP were reduced, meaning that HP must drop in order for damage to have been dealt, and the clarification that states if a card is destroyed any remaining effects of that card are immediately canceled, how is it possible for Cryo Bot to ever deal any damage? If it is dealt damage, it&#39;s destroyed because it only has 1 HP, and the remaining effect of it dealing damage is canceled.</p>",
