      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-08-20T22:13:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Honestly, I don't really see a need for any clarifications.&nbsp; The card specifically says \"This card cannot be played during <strong>your</strong> play phase.\"&nbsp; This means it can be played during any other phase of your turn, or any phase of someone else's turn without any issue.</p>",
